  "lore": {
    "description": "An acid slime organism protected by a thick rocky exoskeleton, the Bioflim was bioengineered by Drainov's Xalian Generator for a world of bubbling acid swamps and steaming corrosive rain. Its slime continually regenerates the outer shell, which is the whole of its defense. Drainov is now held by a loose conglomerate of Vallerii space pirates and interstellar crime syndicates, and its Xalians work the once-abandoned factories, refineries, and chemical plants. The Bioflim stands in the acid of that world and regenerates whatever the acid takes.",
